# Size Category

An ordered category of a size count type.

◇

attributes:
    - key: num
      name: Num
      details: Order of this category within the size count type.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: name
      name: Name
      details: Unique among categories of the same size count type.
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING
    - key: description
      name: Description
      rules: unconstrained
      nullable: true
      type_spec: STRING
